@startuml
title DataPipe - Diagramme d'Etats-Transitions Run (UML pur)
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> pending : creation Run
pending --> running : commande execute

running --> waiting_ai : noeud IA requis
waiting_ai --> running : reponse LLM recue

running --> success : execution complete
running --> error : erreur traitement
pending --> cancelled : annulation
running --> cancelled : annulation

success --> [*]
error --> [*]
cancelled --> [*]
waiting_ai --> error : timeout / echec IA

note right of running
Mises a jour techniques:
- RunLog ajoute
- node_results calcule
- statut pipeline mis a jour
end note

@enduml
